    "text": "If $\\sum_{\\mathrm{r}=1}^9\\left(\\frac{\\mathrm{r}+3}{2^{\\mathrm{r}}}\\right) .{ }^9 \\mathrm{C}_{\\mathrm{r}}=\\alpha\\left(\\frac{3}{2}\\right)^9-\\beta, \\quad \\alpha, \\beta \\in \\mathrm{N}, \\quad$ then $(\\alpha+\\beta)^2$ is equal to",
